<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.39171.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.39171.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.39171, versus 1.39465 Friday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
<p> Deutsche Mark     2.36493   (3.06809)</p>
<p> French Franc	7.98174   (5.82126)</p>
<p> Japanese Yen	161.605   (343.773)</p>
<p> Pounds Sterling   0.852085   (0.505474)</p>
<p> Australian Dlr    1.81780   (0.809889)</p>
<p> Aust Schilling    16.6462   (22.0097)</p>
<p> Belgian Franc     48.7377   (45.9249)</p>
<p> Canadian Dlr	1.92362   (1.16295)</p>
<p> Danish Kroner     8.99253   (7.23304)</p>
<p> Indonesian Rupiah 3365.15   (501.291)</p>
<p> Iranian Rial	  n/a     (81.6734)</p>
<p> Italian Lire	2331.99   (779.746)</p>
<p> Kuwait Dinar	0.420505   (0.351685)</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder     2.65831   (3.20316)</p>
<p> Norwegian Kroner  9.80947   (6.59386)</p>
<p> Saudi Arab Riyal  5.21195   (4.25788)</p>
